// ─── S5: the notes as their own tag (NOTES, 4) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// [the pattern count, then per pattern: its note count, then per note two words] -- word A = lane + 16 x step + 1024 x
// pitch (< 2^17), word B = velocity + 128 x (length in quarter steps x 128 + nudge + 50) (< 2^23): exact in the
// stream's 32-bit floats. A read puts each note in the first free slot of its step; a count past its static bound
