      // leaves cells this reader does not know -- skipped here, so the next tag is read where it starts, as the comment
      // above promises; a tag whose body read PAST its stated length (a record shorter than this build's) has desynced:
      // the read stops, and nothing after the tag is touched (the count rule's answer, wiki 3.5).
      seq_io_rd(_ch) && _ss_ok ? (
